      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERKEEPGOING",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERKEEPGOING.WAV",
      "Text": "Or you can get back in the car and keep going.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERKEEPGOING,  NEWUSERKEEPGOING.WAV,   \u0022Or you can get back in the car and keep going.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERSESOVERSOON",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERPULLOUT.WAV",
      "Text": "The session will be over soon. If you\u0027re still in the car when it ends, we\u0027ll pull you out.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERSESOVERSOON, NEWUSERPULLOUT.WAV,     \u0022The session will be over soon. If you\u0027re still in the car when it ends, we\u0027ll pull you out.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERRACE10",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSER10RACE.WAV",
      "Text": "This is going to be a 10 lap practice race. Don\u0027t worry, nothing is at stake.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERRACE10,     NEWUSER10RACE.WAV,      \u0022This is going to be a 10 lap practice race. Don\u0027t worry, nothing is at stake.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERCANRESTART",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERRESTRACE.WAV",
      "Text": "If you\u0027d like, you can restart the race by clicking the previous button.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERCANRESTART, NEWUSERRESTRACE.WAV,    \u0022If you\u0027d like, you can restart the race by clicking the previous button.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERESCRESTART",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERRESTESC.WAV",
      "Text": "Remember, you can restart the race at any time. To do so, first stop the car, then hold escape.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERESCRESTART, NEWUSERRESTESC.WAV,     \u0022Remember, you can restart the race at any time. To do so, first stop the car, then hold escape.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERGRW1ST",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERGRW1ST.WAV",
      "Text": "Great work on your first race.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERGRW1ST,     NEWUSERGRW1ST.WAV,      \u0022Great work on your first race.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERLEAVEESC",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERLEAVESC.WAV",
      "Text": "When you\u0027re ready to leave, stop the car, and hold down the escape key to exit the car.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERLEAVEESC,   NEWUSERLEAVESC.WAV,     \u0022When you\u0027re ready to leave, stop the car, and hold down the escape key to exit the car.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERQUITCLK",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERQUITRK.WAV",
      "Text": "Then click \u0027Quit\u0027 to leave the track.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERQUITCLK,    NEWUSERQUITRK.WAV,      \u0022Then click \u0027Quit\u0027 to leave the track.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERNICEWK",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERNICEWK.WAV",
      "Text": "Nice work today. See you at the next race.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERNICEWK,     NEWUSERNICEWK.WAV,      \u0022Nice work today. See you at the next race.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERBLKFLG",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERBKFLGICON.WAV",
      "Text": "Watch out, you\u0027ve got a black flag! The reason will be shown next to the flag icon.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERBLKFLG,     NEWUSERBKFLGICON.WAV,   \u0022Watch out, you\u0027ve got a black flag! The reason will be shown next to the flag icon.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERLETSLIDE",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERLETSLIDE.WAV",
      "Text": "We\u0027ll let it slide this time, but in any other race, you\u0027d be penalized.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERLETSLIDE,   NEWUSERLETSLIDE.WAV,    \u0022We\u0027ll let it slide this time, but in any other race, you\u0027d be penalized.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERYELLOW",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERYELLOW.WAV",
      "Text": "There\u0027s a yellow flag, be careful.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERYELLOW,     NEWUSERYELLOW.WAV,      \u0022There\u0027s a yellow flag, be careful.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERRACELAPDOWN",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERFINCUT.WAV",
      "Text": "The cars up front are finishing the race, so it\u0027ll be cut short for us.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERRACELAPDOWN, NEWUSERFINCUT.WAV,     \u0022The cars up front are finishing the race, so it\u0027ll be cut short for us.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERWIN",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERWIN.WAV",
      "Text": "You won! Congratulations! And welcome to iRacing.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERWIN,\t\t\tNEWUSERWIN.WAV,\t\t\t\t\u0022You won! Congratulations! And welcome to iRacing.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERHITWALL",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERWALL.WAV",
      "Text": "Looks like you\u0027ve hit the wall. This gives you two incident points.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERHITWALL,\t\tNEWUSERWALL.WAV,\t\t\t\u0022Looks like you\u0027ve hit the wall. This gives you two incident points.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERHITCAR",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERHITCAR.WAV",
      "Text": "Looks like you\u0027ve hit another car. This gives you four incident points.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERHITCAR,\t\t\tNEWUSERHITCAR.WAV,\t\t\t\u0022Looks like you\u0027ve hit another car. This gives you four incident points.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERRESTARTB",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERRESTR.WAV",
      "Text": "You can restart the race by holding escape again to bring up the menu.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERRESTARTB,\t\tNEWUSERRESTR.WAV,\t\t\t\u0022You can restart the race by holding escape again to bring up the menu.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERMOREPRACTICE",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERMOREPRACTICE.WAV",
      "Text": "Looks like we have an opportunity to improve. Let\u0027s get you in a test drive and keep practicing. Welcome to iRacing.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERMOREPRACTICE,\tNEWUSERMOREPRACTICE.WAV,\t\u0022Looks like we have an opportunity to improve. Let\u0027s get you in a test drive and keep practicing. Welcome to iRacing.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERWARMUPPENALTY",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERWARMUPPENALTY.WAV",
      "Text": "We\u0027ll clear it for you, but in a normal warmup session, you\u0027d have to serve the penalty or reset the car.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERWARMUPPENALTY,\tNEWUSERWARMUPPENALTY.WAV,\t\u0022We\u0027ll clear it for you, but in a normal warmup session, you\u0027d have to serve the penalty or reset the car.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERDRIVINGLINE",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERLINE.WAV",
      "Text": "Notice the driving line on the track. You can accelerate in the green sections and brake in the red sections. Use this to learn the track.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERDRIVINGLINE,\tNEWUSERLINE.WAV,\t\t\t\u0022Notice the driving line on the track. You can accelerate in the green sections and brake in the red sections. Use this to learn the track.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERKEEPUPFNT",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERKEEPUPFNT.WAV",
      "Text": "Keep up with the car in front of you.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERKEEPUPFNT,\t\tNEWUSERKEEPUPFNT.WAV,\t\t\u0022Keep up with the car in front of you.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERJUMPST",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERJMPST.WAV",
      "Text": "Looks like you jumped the start. Restart the race first by stopping the car and holding the escape key to reset to the pits.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERJUMPST,\t\t\tNEWUSERJMPST.WAV,\t\t\t\u0022Looks like you jumped the start. Restart the race first by stopping the car and holding the escape key to reset to the pits.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERRACEOVERSOLID",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERRACESOLID.WAV",
      "Text": "Solid first race. Great job and welcome to iRacing!",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERRACEOVERSOLID,\tNEWUSERRACESOLID.WAV,\t\t\u0022Solid first race. Great job and welcome to iRacing!\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERDAMOFF",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERDAMOFF.WAV",
      "Text": "Damage is turned off for this session so you will see your car fix itself. This won\u0027t be the case in an official session.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERDAMOFF,\t\t\tNEWUSERDAMOFF.WAV,\t\t\t\u0022Damage is turned off for this session so you will see your car fix itself. This won\u0027t be the case in an official session.\u0022"
    },
    {
      "MsgId": "SPCC_NEWUSERSPORTINGCODE",
      "WavFileName": "NEWUSERCODE.WAV",
      "Text": "You can learn more about the incident and safety rating system by reading the sporting code.",
      "Enabled": true,
      "SourceType": 0,
      "GoogleVoiceName": null,
      "RecordedTakePath": null,
      "AllTakes": [],
      "IsComment": false,
      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSERSPORTINGCODE,\tNEWUSERCODE.WAV,\t\t\t\u0022You can learn more about the incident and safety rating system by reading the sporting code.\u0022"
