      "RawLine": "SPCC_NEWUSER2INCPTS,\t\tNEWUSER2INCPTS.WAV,\t\t\t\u0022You\u0027ve just received two incident points. This happens when you hit a wall, spin out, or have light contact with another car.\u0022"
